  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1405.18 Retainage for Construction Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1405.18 Retainage for Construction Projects.\n\n(a) The recipient may withhold a percentage of all partial payments to contractors on a construction project as retainage until the project is complete.\n\n(b) If the recipient intends to withhold a retainage, the recipient shall specify the terms and conditions relating to the retainage in the contract documents submitted pursuant to Env-Dw 1407.03.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; renumbered by #13289 (formerly Env-Dw 1405.17); ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1400.html"
}
